OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with some
OL,6,Fbrighter intervals. A few showers
OL,7,Faround in the morning, but these will
OL,8,Fgradually ease in the afternoon,
OL,9,Fleaving dry conditions. Winds becoming
OL,10,Fstrong with a risk of coastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry and cloudy start to the
OL,13,Fevening. Rain and hill snow arriving
OL,14,Ffrom the west overnight, pushing
OL,15,Feastwards. Some heavier bursts of rain
OL,16,Fat times. Very windy with gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
