OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA wet start to the day. Rain
OL,6,Fclearing eastwards through the
OL,7,Fmorning, to allow for some sunny
OL,8,Fspells to develop through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy,
OL,12,Fwith some light rain or drizzle
OL,13,Fpossible Saturday. Mostly dry with
OL,14,Fbright spells on Sunday, but the odd
OL,15,Fshower possible. Rain and strong winds
OL,16,Farriving from the west Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
